('2921.mp4', 'People: miniature workers, miniature figures, construction workers. Objects: ladder, tart, banana slices, banana, basket. Actions: climbing, arranging, constructing, stacking, assembling. Emotions: playful, whimsical. Scenes: miniature construction, food art, dessert preparation. Concepts: creativity, imagination, surrealism', 'People: miniature workers, miniature figures, construction workers. Objects: ladder, tart, banana sl...', 'miniature workers, miniature figures, construction workers, ladder, tart, banana slices, banana, basket, climbing, arranging, constructing, stacking, assembling, playful, whimsical, miniature construction, food art, dessert preparation, creativity, imagination, surrealism', 'Miniature workers in blue overalls and yellow helmets are constructing a dessert made of banana slices and powdered sugar. The scene is set on a tart, with some workers climbing a ladder while others arrange banana slices. A large banana looms in the background, adding a whimsical touch to the scene.', 'The image depicts a whimsical scene where miniature construction workers are assembling a dessert made of banana slices and powdered sugar. The workers, dressed in blue overalls and yellow hard hats, are carefully stacking banana slices on a tart base. The scene is set against a backdrop of large bananas, adding to the playful scale of the composition.', NULL, '1056x1888', '33:59', 30.0, '5s'),
