('2923.mp4', 'People: woman, silhouettes, person. Objects: suit, necklace, hood, cloak. Actions: standing. Emotions: intensity, mystery. Scenes: dramatic, supernatural, portrait, close-up. Concepts: mystery, power, drama', 'People: woman, silhouettes, person. Objects: suit, necklace, hood, cloak. Actions: standing. Emotion...', 'woman, silhouettes, person, suit, necklace, hood, cloak, standing, intensity, mystery, dramatic, supernatural, portrait, close-up, mystery, power, drama', 'A striking figure with glowing red eyes stands in the foreground, exuding an aura of mystery and intensity. The background is a blurred scene with silhouettes of other figures, set against a dramatic red and black backdrop.', 'A person with dramatic makeup and a hooded cloak stares intensely at the viewer. The background is softly blurred with a red glow, adding to the mysterious atmosphere.', NULL, '1152x1760', '36:55', 30.0, '5s'),
